                    {
                      "uuid": "5e59e02d6bdf4d9eb00d255415699324",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​上下游的销量会相互影响</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "a14179ef9338484db346de5e8b1fb79e",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>eg: ​if companies like Intel and NVIDIA announce slow sales, hardware companies like Dell, Apple, and HP will be expected to go down.</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "2d30c5aa9d164d38a9b3ac5197ddab52",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​eg2:&nbsp;Apple shares tend to react to the performance of some of its key suppliers like Corning, Samsung, Hon Hai Precision, and Broadcom, among others.</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "88b2e2ee28dc4c70a2808a60d385dd62",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​什么时候共振（eg. 供应链企业业绩好，说明苹果销量好）， 什么时候是反指（eg. 大客户集中，压价）</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        }
                      ],
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": "",
