                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​raw materials and currencies</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "18eabc114f80408fbf89159e18ecc5c7",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>eg: ​when the price of crude oil jumps, chances are that the stocks of oil exploring companies like ExxonMobil and Chevron will rise as well.</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "7bcd40ad01714961827fb108d577f6b1",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​比如中海油的股价就和油价相关系数非常高，​但是中石油中石化就相关性很低。原因是，一个是采油，一个是转售</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "children": null,
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": ""
                            }
                          ],
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": ""
                        },
                        {
