                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​eg2:&nbsp;when the price of gold rises, that of gold mining companies will rise too</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": "",
                          "ttMaxW": 555,
                          "ttW": 555
                        },
                        {
                          "uuid": "1d6582381ea14d9e829bfd27a4fa2aa1",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​eg3:&nbsp; if the price of cotton rises, it will squeeze the margins of companies like Adidas leading to their stock price to decline</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
